{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:620","content":{"id":620,"title":"桥和割点","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"5aa408ac-be45-489f-860f-68ccfd196ea6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"桥"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"bed882eb-6147-44b8-9bb8-9ed4e6321d21","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"定义"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6647cc18-22b1-4997-8fbc-ce645e1b8103","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们首先看一下桥的概念"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dca603e0-4614-4d7d-8fda-21682a562552.webp","uuid":"bec57360-f0c6-4f5d-9f00-786bc3313917","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dca603e0-4614-4d7d-8fda-21682a562552.webp","width":340.4166531397242,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"f2e56c5f-225e-4a47-acdb-692d7b66d72d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8fe0435a-bb74-405b-a468-e75b13278cc9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面这幅图中，我们称节点 3-5 之间的这条边为桥，它具有什么特点呢? 一旦将这条边去掉，图的联通分量就会发生变化，所以有如下定义："}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"251d13b3-ac7b-4490-aa08-9b9f2a7ccce5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ae612859-ce67-4db8-912f-57c66a89c34b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果去掉某条边，使得图的联通分量发生变化，那么称这条边为桥。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"23cec9bd-08fd-4ca1-896f-05ff3e5b5d0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"桥可以看做是图中最脆弱的那条边，如果将交通系统建模为一个图的话，桥就是交通系统中最脆弱的部分，在军事中如果我们知道对方交通系统中的桥，那么我们就可以军事打击这个桥，使得对方的交通系统瘫痪。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"47494589-92ca-473b-a809-24badf21230c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找桥"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"80db9b39-b70f-4f0e-bac7-8c803ac564a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何判断某条边是不是桥，对于下图来说， "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0-1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条边是桥吗?"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2a875ce4-a170-4bba-85cb-b29a3ea26c43.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2a875ce4-a170-4bba-85cb-b29a3ea26c43.png","width":366.2499854465332,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"70840524-0754-482b-9830-ebd0becb9de8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6ffddfbd-47bb-419e-8713-6135e79fea46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"答案不是，因为去掉 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0-1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条边联通分量的个数没有增加，原因是节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以通过另一条路径 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1->3->2->0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 到达 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以我们判断某条边是不是桥，就是判断边的两个节点是否有另外一条路径。考虑边 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v-w"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果存在另外一条路径，使得节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者是节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前的节点，我们就认为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v-w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不是桥，否则没有另外的路径使得节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们就认为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v-w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是桥。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"73d3ea08-84b0-425e-9357-cf72a173ac68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了完成这个判断，我们需要定义两个变量来帮助我们保存信息，一个是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"order[]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组，它保存的是以 DFS 遍历图的顺序，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"order[0] = 0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个遍历的，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"order[3] = 2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个遍历的"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/76ab30027ca90366b9dd2c8c55e872eb_e59fe102-f118-4aea-b446-d303f453c95f.gif","uuid":"4c2597a3-1720-4386-9f90-eab3b7b0df1d","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/76ab30027ca90366b9dd2c8c55e872eb_e59fe102-f118-4aea-b446-d303f453c95f.gif","width":601.6666427585823,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"0d168c38-37a5-49bd-a004-dc8bc9b3c54a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4653455c-2937-4dee-9bb8-d91f401d8b32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一个需要记录的信息是当前节点通过另外一条路径(即不是父节点那条路径)能够达到的顺序最前的节点，使用数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示，假设节点 2 能够达到最前的节点 0，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"order[0] = 0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[2] = order[0] = 0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，初始 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[i] = order[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组有两个时机"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0e29b4f3-530e-4750-8cab-7a07a0d0c21f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2a13f81e-e7fa-452a-9ee9-119c19b99848","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8aa19610-7b39-43e7-94de-b9694116edd3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 访问已被遍历过的邻接节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时(该邻接节点不为父节点)，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w] < low[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[v] = low[w]"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/df30264cc6229d8f7034c30605f95070_009a6380-e51e-4a36-a5a5-b01524f586ce.gif","uuid":"e3b617ff-fa76-41ff-943d-bd356616249e","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/df30264cc6229d8f7034c30605f95070_009a6380-e51e-4a36-a5a5-b01524f586ce.gif","width":601.6666427585823,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"5dd9e375-4cc4-4a0e-ae85-132abdf653b4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f3a10207-8cf9-4532-9f86-977f2d58a6e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们访问到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，接着访问节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的邻接节点，访问到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不是它的父亲节点(上一个节点)，而且节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 已经被访问过，并且 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[0] < low[2]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以这个时候更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[2] = low[0]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能通过另一条路径访问第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[0]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个遍历的节点，即节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能够访问到第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个被遍历的节点，即节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2dff04aa-64f7-48c5-ba30-7ecab65f41f8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aedb50c4-d135-483c-a1c1-c017fb6c990b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"访问完邻接节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，回到当前节点 v 时，如果邻接节点的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w] < low[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[v] = low[w]"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/df30264cc6229d8f7034c30605f95070%20(1)_427adaa1-786f-4c9e-b217-7790a4e63871.gif","uuid":"fc230633-1282-4c59-ba5f-8a86188f4cf5","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/df30264cc6229d8f7034c30605f95070%20(1)_427adaa1-786f-4c9e-b217-7790a4e63871.gif","width":601.6666427585823,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"9f78d822-489c-46db-b59e-218200985e1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d2a19c7c-ceff-401a-955c-820bd9517524","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当节点访问完节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 回到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，此时 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[2] < low[3]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[3] = low[2] = 0"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[3]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以从另外一条路径到达第 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[2] = 0"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个被遍历的节点，即节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d769d55f-2adf-47d7-9359-c5a67b6772c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"引入了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"order"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组，接着我们可以根据这两个数组判断某条边是不是桥了，当我们遍历完相邻节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，来到当前节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，除了要更新 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们还需要对这条边是不是桥进行判断。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79143cdb-b9f9-4445-aeef-ddc04d06c98e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们需要判断 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"order[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的大小，以此判断是否是桥。首先明确一下二者表示的意义："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"8a29225b-d896-474f-bcf3-4c0f9d3b3277","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9072a09f-b2cf-47f5-a4dd-a655dca518b0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"23572a72-a39a-4bc3-8ec3-bbfceff90925","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能够通过另一条路径能够到达的最前顺序，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w] = 3"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就表示 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 节点能通过另一条路径到达第 3 个被遍历的节点，"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7f1b01c2-3e02-49c5-ac78-8515452dd32e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5a9ffb36-3c78-4e20-ba74-63fe43d6e220","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"order [v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示节点 v 是第几个被遍历的"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f5d39f8b-3808-49ee-b778-557f76f42917","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w] <= order[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，说明 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能通过另一条路径到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前被遍历的节点，说明就不是桥，否则就是桥。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"1877ad2b-56af-44bb-883d-e27f94e5c1d0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"21659cd0-82eb-4995-83c3-7311638f731b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.HashSet;\n\npublic class FindEdge {\n    private int[] order;\n    private int[] low;\n    private Graph graph;\n    private boolean[] visited;\n    private int count = 0;\n\n    // 存储桥\n    private ArrayList<int[]> result;\n\n    public FindEdge(Graph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        order = new int[graph.V()];\n        low = new int[graph.V()];\n        result = new ArrayList<>();\n        visited = new boolean[graph.V()];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < graph.V(); i++) {\n            if (!visited[i]) {\n                dfs(i, i);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private void dfs(int v, int parent) {\n        visited[v] = true;\n        low[v] = count;\n        order[v] = count;\n        count++;\n\n        for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n            if (!visited[w]) {\n                dfs(w, v);\n                // 更新 low[v] 时机 1\n                low[v] = Math.min(low[v], low[w]);\n                // 判断是否是桥\n                if (low[w] > order[v]) {\n                    result.add(new int[]{v, w});\n                }\n            } else if (w != parent){\n                // 更细 low[v] 时机 2\n                low[v] = Math.min(low[w], low[v]);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public ArrayList<int[]> getResult() {\n        return result;\n    }\n}","collabId":"5dd0db40-1654-4a67-94a2-083cb3032dda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"9ddf9cf0-8fd0-4b00-9238-20f92275607d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"割点"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"cf55ed26-0756-4640-9566-e4b41fc2b5c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"定义"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c7e346ad-6d91-49c9-b5cf-5d14ebf04094","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"割点的定义与桥的定义类似，割点指的是一个节点，如果一旦移除这个节点，会导致图中的联通分量发生变化，那么就称这个节点为割点。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c8a8bf23-0d5a-42c9-95cd-ab0d3bbf1e11.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c8a8bf23-0d5a-42c9-95cd-ab0d3bbf1e11.png","width":343.33331969049294,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"74f3efba-d4dd-4e9b-aa14-f58573abfe61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0cfac7fd-bf69-4791-b6e1-819c8820d965","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上图中节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"5"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为割点，一旦去掉这两个节点之一，图的联通分量的个数就会发生变化。"}]},{"type":"header","level":3,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"07385a7a-1848-42bc-b895-d08fabf2dc34","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找割点"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"24b57a7a-16d4-4247-bfdc-9708a382bfa8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找割点的过程同寻找桥是一样的，也需要维护 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"order"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 两个数组，这两数组的含义也是同上一致的。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组的更新时机以及更新过程也是同上一致的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"28fa2c31-d5bb-4314-bd7e-703696b576bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在的问题是我们在什么时候判断某节点是不是割点，以及条件是什么。我们在遍历完相邻节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回到当前节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w] >= order[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，就说明它是一个割点。这里的判断条件与桥的判断不同，桥的判断条件是如果 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w] > order[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，就说明 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v-w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条边是桥，注意多了一个等于号。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79c3ab95-d5cb-400c-beb1-22e12c203e20","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[w] >=order[v]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前被遍历的节点产生连接只能通过节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"v"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_472abf5b-1899-488c-bcc1-a057ec504ee7.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_472abf5b-1899-488c-bcc1-a057ec504ee7.png","width":378.333318299718,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"bd05b17e-ebfb-42e6-b6fe-8b0b4ff2d796","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e59c6df5-d809-4c1a-9aaf-9df817569518","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例如节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"4"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通过另外一条路径它最多到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"5"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法与节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"5"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前被遍历的节点产生连接。一旦节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"5"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 被删除，4 就无法访问到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0, 1, 2, 3"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"5"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是割点。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e88b738e-7171-48e9-9986-1d8308ca9f2f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是添加了等于号之后，这个时候因为任何节点 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"low[v] >= order[0]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以根节点 0 会被认为是割点，但根节点不一定是割点，这个时候我们就需要对根节点分别讨论，判断根节点是不是割点很简单，如果通过 DFS 遍历，根节点有两个相邻节点就说明它是割点"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e435b300-8eb6-4de0-88f2-c1222b98a96b.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e435b300-8eb6-4de0-88f2-c1222b98a96b.png","width":719.9999713897716,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"4d5175fd-2552-40a7-b7b8-7be86ab3fd44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"a7e185c0-6c87-4e37-bcc6-14c8a6c422b5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2eb9ffa1-2782-419e-97ce-dc910c21e206","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.HashSet;\n\npublic class FindCutPoints {\n    private Graph graph;\n    private boolean[] visited;\n    private int[] order;\n    private int[] low;\n    private int count = 0;\n\n    private HashSet<Integer> result = new HashSet<>();\n\n    public FindCutPoints(Graph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n\n        visited = new boolean[graph.V()];\n        order = new int[graph.V()];\n        low = new int[graph.V()];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < graph.V(); i++) {\n            if (!visited[i]) {\n                dfs(i, i);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private void dfs(int v, int parent) {\n        visited[v] = true;\n        order[v] = count;\n        low[v] = count;\n        count++;\n\n        int child = 0;\n        for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n            child++;\n            if (!visited[w]) {\n                dfs(w, v);\n                low[v] = Math.min(low[v], low[w]);\n                if (v != parent && low[w] >= order[v]) {\n                    result.add(v);\n                }\n                if (v == parent && child > 1) {\n                    result.add(v);\n                }\n            } else if (w != parent) {\n                low[v] = Math.min(low[v], low[w]);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public HashSet<Integer> getResult() {\n        return result;\n    }\n}","collabId":"f810719d-b11c-46e3-bf87-2ef2278e74d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"桥和割点","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:620","type":"doc","id":620}}],"prevPage":{"title":"滑动谜题","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:619","type":"doc","id":619}},"nextPage":{"title":"哈密尔顿回路","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:621","type":"doc","id":621}},"createTime":1702052079120,"updateTime":1775929823128,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775929823128}}